@startuml
' From the photo of a business drawing to a tested flow: the code agent loops until every guard is green
!include _style.iuml
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor $LLM_BG
  BorderColor $LLM_LINE
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  DiamondBorderColor #777777
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #BBBBBB
  TitleFontStyle bold
  TitleFontSize 13
}

|#FFFDF2|Business|
start
:Draws the journey\nand sends the photo; <<$ASK_BG>>
|#F6F9FF|Code agent|
:Reads the ""new-flow"" skill\nand opens CANCEL, the example to copy;
:Fills in what the drawing does not say\n<size:11>forgotten statuses, order not found…</size>;
repeat
  :Writes or fixes the flow package\n<size:11>steps, messages, translations, tests</size>;
  |#F7FCF6|Automatic guards|
  :""make format"", ""make check"", ""make test""; <<$STEP_BG>>
repeat while (a guard fails?) is (yes: a precise error code) not (no)
|Code agent|
:Hands in a report\n<size:11>diagram of the flow, what it added,</size>\n<size:11>what is not checked</size>;
|#FFFDF2|Developer|
:Reviews the report, and the code\nwhere the report flags an addition; <<$ASK_BG>>
:Writes and labels the eval cases,\nthen runs ""make eval""; <<$ASK_BG>>
stop
legend bottom
  <back:$ASK_BG>      </back> human    <back:$LLM_BG>      </back> code agent    <back:$STEP_BG>      </back> automatic check
endlegend
@enduml
